  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "25145590",
      "title": "Navigating to the \"Filtered Events\" Page Progammatically",
      "lectureOrder": 258,
      "videoOrder": 240,
      "sourceHash": "094257068d3304d17dfbd4b94090946b2df90178aa5190883d0b86f58a307b6d",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.11,
          "end": 3.61,
          "en": "Let's add some logic",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.61,
          "end": 5.69,
          "en": "to the EventsSearch component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.69,
          "end": 6.8,
          "en": "We get this form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 6.8,
          "end": 9.3,
          "en": "but at the moment when this button is pressed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 9.3,
          "end": 10.98,
          "en": "and the form is submitted,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 10.98,
          "end": 13.97,
          "en": "we're not doing anything with that submitted data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 13.97,
          "end": 15.77,
          "en": "And that should change.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 15.77,
          "end": 18.35,
          "en": "Therefore, I'll start by adding a nested function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 18.35,
          "end": 20.29,
          "en": "in the EventsSearch component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 20.29,
          "end": 22.83,
          "en": "and I'll name this function submitHandler.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 22.83,
          "end": 25,
          "en": "That's the function that should be triggered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 25,
          "end": 27.56,
          "en": "when the form is submitted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 27.56,
          "end": 29.15,
          "en": "So, on the form element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 29.15,
          "end": 31.39,
          "en": "we can add the onSubmit prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 31.39,
          "end": 34.3,
          "en": "and point at submitHandler like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 34.3,
          "end": 36.73,
          "en": "Don't execute it, just point at it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 36.73,
          "end": 40.03,
          "en": "So, that submitHandler is executed by react",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 40.03,
          "end": 42.15,
          "en": "when the form is submitted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 42.15,
          "end": 45.47,
          "en": "Now, as you know, for example, from my react course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 45.47,
          "end": 48.38,
          "en": "we automatically get an event object here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 48.38,
          "end": 51.91,
          "en": "because we're listening to a default Dom event.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 51.91,
          "end": 56.74,
          "en": "And here we should call event dot preventDefault",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 56.74,
          "end": 61.71,
          "en": "to prevent the browser default off sending an http request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 61.71,
          "end": 63.15,
          "en": "which I don't wanna do here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 63.15,
          "end": 65.07,
          "en": "and which would reload our page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 65.07,
          "end": 68.9,
          "en": "and therefore lose all our applications state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 68.9,
          "end": 71.97,
          "en": "Instead, I wanna handle this submission with JavaScript",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 71.97,
          "end": 75.12,
          "en": "and therefore we prevent that default.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 75.12,
          "end": 76.41,
          "en": "And once that is prevented,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 76.41,
          "end": 79.97,
          "en": "we can now read the selected year and month.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 79.97,
          "end": 82.73,
          "en": "Now for that, we could set up two way binding",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 82.73,
          "end": 85.13,
          "en": "with use state and so on,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 85.13,
          "end": 88.14,
          "en": "but since I'm only interested in the values once",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 88.14,
          "end": 89.7,
          "en": "when the form is submitted,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 89.7,
          "end": 91.53,
          "en": "I'll instead work with refs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 91.53,
          "end": 95.05,
          "en": "Another key react feature which you should be aware of.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 95.05,
          "end": 98.42,
          "en": "If you're not, definitely take a react refresher,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 98.42,
          "end": 100.91,
          "en": "or take my react to complete guide course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 100.91,
          "end": 104.793,
          "en": "where I dive into all react concepts in great depth.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 105.87,
          "end": 109.55,
          "en": "So, here we'll then import useRef from react,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 109.55,
          "end": 112.37,
          "en": "and then we can set up our refs here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 112.37,
          "end": 116.12,
          "en": "and we'll need two refs since we have two inputs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 116.12,
          "end": 118.52000000000001,
          "en": "We'll have the yearInputRef",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 118.52000000000001,
          "end": 121.962,
          "en": "and hence I'll create my first ref with useRef",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 121.962,
          "end": 124.15,
          "en": "and the monthInputRef.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 124.15,
          "end": 126.68299999999999,
          "en": "And hence here I'll create this as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 127.543,
          "end": 129.66,
          "en": "And now that get these two refs created,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 129.66,
          "end": 133.18,
          "en": "we need to connect them to select elements.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 133.18,
          "end": 134.9,
          "en": "So, on the year select element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 134.9,
          "end": 136.89,
          "en": "I'll add to the special ref prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 136.89,
          "end": 139.8,
          "en": "and point at the yearInputRef,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 139.8,
          "end": 142.15,
          "en": "and on the month select element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 142.15,
          "end": 146.523,
          "en": "I'll also add the ref prop and point at the monthInputRef.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 147.61,
          "end": 149.32,
          "en": "Now, the refs are connected",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 149.32,
          "end": 151.69,
          "en": "and therefor now in this submitHandler,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 151.69,
          "end": 154.49,
          "en": "we can get the selectedYear",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 154.49,
          "end": 157.7,
          "en": "by accessing yearInputRef dot current.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 157.7,
          "end": 160.35,
          "en": "You always use dot current to get access",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 160.35,
          "end": 163.99,
          "en": "to the actual value the ref is connected to,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 163.99,
          "end": 166.11,
          "en": "so, in this case to the select element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 166.11,
          "end": 170.07,
          "en": "And then since this gives us access to the select element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 170.07,
          "end": 173.22,
          "en": "so, to the JavaScript object representing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 173.22,
          "end": 175.01,
          "en": "that select element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 175.01,
          "end": 177.48,
          "en": "we can access the value property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 177.48,
          "end": 180.78,
          "en": "which every select JavaScript object has.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 180.78,
          "end": 182.74,
          "en": "So, every JavaScript object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 182.74,
          "end": 186.17,
          "en": "representing a select element has a value property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 186.17,
          "end": 187.89,
          "en": "Therefore, we can access this here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 187.89,
          "end": 190.87,
          "en": "to get access to the selected value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 190.87,
          "end": 194.06,
          "en": "And we repeat that for the selected month.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 194.06,
          "end": 197.32999999999998,
          "en": "So, with monthInputRef dot current dot value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 197.32999999999998,
          "end": 199.86,
          "en": "we get access to the selected value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 199.86,
          "end": 201.893,
          "en": "on the month select element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 203.07999999999998,
          "end": 206.37,
          "en": "And now we just need to kind of do something",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 206.37,
          "end": 208.67000000000002,
          "en": "with those values.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 208.67000000000002,
          "end": 212.64,
          "en": "And I don't want to utilize them here in EventsSearch,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 212.64,
          "end": 214.4,
          "en": "even though we could do that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 214.4,
          "end": 218.79,
          "en": "but instead I want to pass them to my AllEventsPage.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 219.71,
          "end": 224.71,
          "en": "And in there, I then want to programmatically navigate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 224.94,
          "end": 228.28,
          "en": "to that slug page here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 228.28,
          "end": 231.1,
          "en": "And here we need programmatic navigation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 231.1,
          "end": 234.38,
          "en": "because you wanna do that once some action completed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 234.38,
          "end": 237.81,
          "en": "In this case, once the form submission completed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 237.81,
          "end": 241.12,
          "en": "and we extracted all the form values.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 241.12,
          "end": 245.39,
          "en": "So, that's a typical example for programmatic navigation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 245.39,
          "end": 247.39,
          "en": "Hence as a first step,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 247.39,
          "end": 249.87,
          "en": "I do expect that on the props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 249.87,
          "end": 252.38,
          "en": "of this EventsSearch component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 252.38,
          "end": 256.25,
          "en": "I have a prop let's say named onSearch.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 256.25,
          "end": 257.41,
          "en": "This name is up to you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 257.41,
          "end": 260.83,
          "en": "but I'll name it onSearch following this convention",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 260.83,
          "end": 263.43,
          "en": "because I expect that onSearch,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 263.43,
          "end": 266.31,
          "en": "the value for this prop is a function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 266.31,
          "end": 268.5,
          "en": "which I therefor can execute here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 268.5,
          "end": 272.22,
          "en": "And it should be a function which accepts two parameters,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 272.22,
          "end": 276.313,
          "en": "the selected year and the selected month.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 277.34000000000003,
          "end": 280.64,
          "en": "So, I'll call this function and now we need to make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 280.64,
          "end": 282.86,
          "en": "that such a function is passed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 282.86,
          "end": 287.13,
          "en": "into EventsSearch through the onSearch prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 287.13,
          "end": 290.71,
          "en": "So, in this index JS file in the events folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 290.71,
          "end": 293.14,
          "en": "so therefore on the AllEventsPage.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 293.14,
          "end": 296.063,
          "en": "We now need to set up this function here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 297.04,
          "end": 301,
          "en": "Here we need to add a new function in this component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 301,
          "end": 304.84,
          "en": "The findEventsHandler function, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 304.84,
          "end": 308.37,
          "en": "which expects a year and the month in this order",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 308.37,
          "end": 311.2,
          "en": "because that's how I'm then calling this function here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 311.2,
          "end": 313.7,
          "en": "We're calling this function and we're passing in a year",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 313.7,
          "end": 317.213,
          "en": "as a first argument and a month as a second argument.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 318.15,
          "end": 320.02,
          "en": "Hence, that's what I expect here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 320.02,
          "end": 322.11,
          "en": "And then we do something with that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 322.11,
          "end": 324.38,
          "en": "And it's now this function which is passed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 324.38,
          "end": 328.27,
          "en": "to the EventsSearch component through the onSearch prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 328.27,
          "end": 330.5,
          "en": "which we just use in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 330.5,
          "end": 333.77,
          "en": "So, here I then pass at findEventsHandler.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 333.77,
          "end": 335.40999999999997,
          "en": "We don't execute it here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 335.40999999999997,
          "end": 336.86,
          "en": "We just point edit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 336.86,
          "end": 339.36,
          "en": "So that it's executed for us,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 339.36,
          "end": 342.53,
          "en": "by this EventsSearch component here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 342.53,
          "end": 344.53,
          "en": "with this line of code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 344.53,
          "end": 348.883,
          "en": "after the form was submitted and we extracted our values.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 350.2,
          "end": 354.84000000000003,
          "en": "So, then here findEventsHandler will execute.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 354.84000000000003,
          "end": 358.58299999999997,
          "en": "And in here we now want to programmatically navigate.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 359.86,
          "end": 363.043,
          "en": "So for that, we can import useRouter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 364.4,
          "end": 369.4,
          "en": "from next slash router like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 371.39,
          "end": 375.3,
          "en": "and then call useRouter here outside",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 375.3,
          "end": 379.46,
          "en": "of this inner function directly in the component function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 379.46,
          "end": 382.39,
          "en": "All react hooks need to be called directly",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 382.39,
          "end": 383.88,
          "en": "in your component function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 383.88,
          "end": 386.543,
          "en": "not in any nested block statements.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 387.46,
          "end": 390.97,
          "en": "And that gives us access to the router like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 390.97,
          "end": 394.22,
          "en": "And on this router inside of the findEventsHandler,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 394.22,
          "end": 398.4,
          "en": "we can then call push to go to a different page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 398.4,
          "end": 402.6,
          "en": "That's what you also learned in the previous course section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 402.6,
          "end": 406.32,
          "en": "Now I'll construct the fullPath I wanna go to here",
          "zh": ""
        },
